			<div id="post-15814" class="post-15814 tribe_events type-tribe_events status-publish has-post-thumbnail hentry entry has-media">
			<!-- Event featured image, but exclude link -->
			<div class="tribe-events-event-image"><img width="1279" height="720" src="https://scaleupporto.pt/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1781789018569.png" class="attachment-full size-full wp-post-image" alt="" srcset="https://scaleupporto.pt/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1781789018569.png 1279w, https://scaleupporto.pt/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1781789018569-300x169.png 300w, https://scaleupporto.pt/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1781789018569-1024x576.png 1024w, https://scaleupporto.pt/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/1781789018569-768x432.png 768w" sizes="(max-width: 1279px) 100vw, 1279px" /></div>
			<!-- Event content -->
						<div class="tribe-events-single-event-description tribe-events-content">
				<p>Startup Summit is one of Europe’s leading startup conferences, bringing together founders, investors, corporates, and ecosystem leaders for a large-scale event focused on entrepreneurship, innovation, fundraising, and business growth.</p>
<p class="zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text" data-w-component="text">The summit features keynote talks, panel discussions, startup showcases, networking opportunities, and investor meetings, creating a platform for startups to connect with venture capitalists, partners, and industry experts.</p>
			</div>
			<!-- .tribe-events-single-event-description -->
			<div class="tribe-events-cal-links"><a class="tribe-events-gcal tribe-events-button" href="https://www.google.com/calendar/event?action=TEMPLATE&#038;text=Startup+Summit+Lisbon+2026&#038;dates=20260917/20260919&#038;details=Startup+Summit+is+one+of+Europe%E2%80%99s+leading+startup+conferences%2C+bringing+together+founders%2C+investors%2C+corporates%2C+and+ecosystem+leaders+for+a+large-scale+event+focused+on+entrepreneurship%2C+innovation%2C+fundraising%2C+and+business+growth.%0AThe+summit+features+keynote+talks%2C+panel+discussions%2C+startup+showcases%2C+networking+opportunities%2C+and+investor+meetings%2C+creating+a+platform+for+startups+to+connect+with+venture+capitalists%2C+partners%2C+and+industry+experts.+&#038;location=Beato+Innovation+District%2C+Av.+Infante+Dom+Henrique+143%2C+1950-406%2C+Lisbon%2C+Portugal&#038;trp=false&#038;sprop=website:https://scaleupporto.pt&#038;ctz=Europe%2FLondon" title="Add to Google Calendar">+ Google Calendar</a><a class="tribe-events-ical tribe-events-button" href="https://scaleupporto.pt/event/startup-summit-lisbon-2026/?ical=1" title="Download .ics file" >+ iCal Export</a></div><!-- .tribe-events-cal-links -->
